  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Key trade-offs",
      "items": [
        "Load balancer: It becomes a potential single point of failure itself → you put at least two; sessions must not live in i",
        "App server: State (sessions, uploads in progress) must be moved out, to a shared cache/DB.",
        "Database: It's the natural bottleneck under load: this is where caches, replicas and sharding come from.",
        "Cache: It must be invalidated when the source changes, or you serve stale data."
      ]
    }
